{"4394410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Inner Rooms", "steam_appid": 4394410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4736490], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inner Rooms</strong> is a short, impactful narrative game inspired by <i>dreamcore</i> and <i>liminal spaces</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore calm, familiar places that seem to stretch beyond what they should be.<br>Valleys that feel endless.<br>Isolated houses wrapped in silence.<br>Empty playrooms, abandoned pools, lifeless school corridors, offices where time appears to have stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing in these spaces is explicitly wrong — yet nothing feels right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move forward, the world begins to respond.<br>Repetition gains meaning.<br>What starts calm and familiar slowly fractures, building toward something far less stable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A constant presence follows throughout the experience.<br>Not clearly an enemy — nor entirely an ally.<br>Something that observes, pursues, and embodies fear, insecurity, and fragmented identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inner Rooms</strong> does not explain everything.<br>Its narrative is symbolic, subtle, and open to interpretation.<br>The experience is short, but designed to stay with you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inner Rooms</strong> is a short, impactful narrative game inspired by <i>dreamcore</i> and <i>liminal spaces</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore calm, familiar places that seem to stretch beyond what they should be.<br>Valleys that feel endless.<br>Isolated houses wrapped in silence.<br>Empty playrooms, abandoned pools, lifeless school corridors, offices where time appears to have stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing in these spaces is explicitly wrong — yet nothing feels right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move forward, the world begins to respond.<br>Repetition gains meaning.<br>What starts calm and familiar slowly fractures, building toward something far less stable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A constant presence follows throughout the experience.<br>Not clearly an enemy — nor entirely an ally.<br>Something that observes, pursues, and embodies fear, insecurity, and fragmented identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inner Rooms</strong> does not explain everything.<br>Its narrative is symbolic, subtle, and open to interpretation.<br>The experience is short, but designed to stay with you.</p>", "short_description": "Wander through vast, unsettling liminal spaces as a quiet presence grows alongside you. Inner Rooms is a psychological atmospheric exploration game set in a world that appears calm and peaceful, yet constantly radiates unease.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Norwegian, Romanian, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394410/a2e4e2c653f0a8a03a42bc4d5f6fb04c17f09441/header.jpg?t=1787319556", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394410/044ce4c57f85b6a163659d0e9c4a3d55f01f46ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787319556", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394410/044ce4c57f85b6a163659d0e9c4a3d55f01f46ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787319556", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 6600 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Inner Rooms requires a GPU with hardware Ray Tracing support, as it is essential to the game's real-time lighting system. GPUs without hardware Ray Tracing support are not officially supported and may experience incorrect lighting, black areas, or severe visual artifacts.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400 / AMD Ryzen 5 5600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 8GB / AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT 12GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Sojon Productions"], "publishers": ["Sojon Productions"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394410/fa64352362afc2dd038ad80c7c4c1993c496b6f4/ss_fa64352362afc2dd038ad80c7c4c1993c496b6f4.600x338.jpg?t=1787319556", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394410/fa64352362afc2dd038ad80c7c4c1993c496b6f4/ss_fa64352362afc2dd038ad80c7c4c1993c496b6f4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787319556"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstat